## Input

```angular
@if (a > b) {
  <p>{{a}} is greater than {{b}}</p>
} @else if (b > a) {
  <p>{{a}} is less than {{b}}</p>
} @else if (a === b) {
  <p>{{a}} is equal to {{b}}</p>
} @else {
  <p>unknown</p>
}

@if (users$ | async; as users) {
  {{ users.length }}
}

```


